import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About">
  <div class="prose">
    <h1>About ModY</h1>
    <p>ModY is a small, independent directory of Tesla accessories and mods, starting with the Model Y. It exists because finding the right accessory usually means wading through look-alike listings, padded "top 10" lists, and unclear fitment.</p>
    <h2>Our rules</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Real products only.</strong> Every listing links to the manufacturer or a major retailer.</li>
      <li><strong>No invented prices or scores.</strong> Prices change constantly, so we send you to the retailer for the current price.</li>
      <li><strong>Fitment first.</strong> We note which model years and configurations each item is listed for.</li>
      <li><strong>Plain notes.</strong> Who it's for, and the trade-offs.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>How ModY will pay for itself</h2>
    <p>Down the road, ModY may use clearly labeled featured listings, affiliate links, or sponsors. Paid placement will always be marked, and it will never change the notes or the fitment info.</p>
    <p>ModY is not affiliated with Tesla, Inc.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
